; What Flow does for Message

Operation
[ address:[ FlowId Process Metaflow Sender ] lock:Lock request:Request ] ; imports
[ Identify.Process                             ; operations: find the flow a process belongs to
  Lock.Metaflow                                ;   record the lock
  Write.{ FlowId                               ;   place the request in the current flow
          Sender
          Request }
  Release.Metaflow ]                           ;   remove the lock after writing
[ Identified.Metaflow                          ; outcomes
  Locked.Lock
  Written
  Released
  Failed.[ Unidentified
           Held
           Unknown
           Unwritten
           StoreRefused ] ]
[]                                             ; types
